{"unit_id":"y2zyyr__smart-session-title#card-zh","repo":"y2zyyr/smart-session-title","commit":"f7887be5d44e1498f7c366852d5e74646b3f558e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"smart-session-title（DSH 网页插件）：为会话生成简洁、可管理的标题。它注册替代标题 provider，并压缩过长提示、跳过弱语义输入；用户可从会话操作生成标题，也可在设置页配置模型、风格、语言、日期和排除词。还支持预览后应用、锁定标题以及批量整理历史会话。适合希望标题更清楚、便于查找和维护的人。标题生成会调用 DSH 当前会话或指定模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:86-120","lib/provider.js:148-187","client.js:4-7","lib/title-preview.js:32-85"]}
{"unit_id":"y2zyyr__smart-session-title#card-en","repo":"y2zyyr/smart-session-title","commit":"f7887be5d44e1498f7c366852d5e74646b3f558e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"smart-session-title (DSH web plugin) generates titles through a replacement provider. It compresses long prompts and skips weak inputs. Users can configure the model, preview and apply titles, lock titles, or batch edit sessions. Generation uses the session model or a configured provider.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:86-120","lib/provider.js:148-187","client.js:4-7","lib/title-preview.js:32-85"]}
