{"unit_id":"y2zyyr__smart-session-title#feature-1","repo":"y2zyyr/smart-session-title","commit":"f7887be5d44e1498f7c366852d5e74646b3f558e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"smart-session-title 的功能「自动生成标题」：根据会话任务生成标题，先压缩超长输入并过滤弱语义内容，再通过当前或指定模型请求标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/provider.js:323-410","lib/title-policy.js:528-558"]}
