{"unit_id":"y2zyyr__smart-session-title#caveat-1","repo":"y2zyyr/smart-session-title","commit":"f7887be5d44e1498f7c366852d5e74646b3f558e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"smart-session-title 使用前须知：标题生成会把处理后的会话任务内容发送给当前会话模型或配置的 provider；配置的模型可能不同于会话模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/provider.js:156-173","lib/title-policy.js:528-558"]}
